          "kind": "therefore",
          "text": "\\(a=2-\\sqrt2，b=\\sqrt2-1\\)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "therefore",
          "text": "\\(\\frac{a+2b}{ab}=3+2\\sqrt2\\)，最小值为 \\(3+2\\sqrt2\\)"
